{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game simulates the real experience of off-road motorcycle riding. Freely ride your motorcycle through the mountains and fully experience the thrill and challenge of off-road driving.Players will navigate through mountainous terrain without paved roads, facing obstacles like rocks and trees. Colliding with obstacles or falling from a height will cause the rider to fall off the bike. The motorcycle is equipped with a realistic physics system, allowing it to automatically roll down slopes, greatly enhancing the challenge and excitement of off-road riding.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547890?t=1740455634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547890?t=1740455634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547890/36b09dcff349d601e1979ca198e36e2040e7718f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740455634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547890/36b09dcff349d601e1979ca198e36e2040e7718f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740455634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game simulates the real experience of off-road motorcycle riding. Freely ride your motorcycle through the mountains and fully experience the thrill and challenge of off-road driving.Players will navigate through mountainous terrain without paved roads, facing obstacles like rocks and trees. Colliding with obstacles or falling from a height will cause the rider to fall off the bike. The motorcycle is equipped with a realistic physics system, allowing it to automatically roll down slopes, greatly enhancing the challenge and excitement of off-road riding.</p>","developers":["rider"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description